.TH SHB-UPDATE 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.1.0" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-update \- Check for and install SecretHarbor updates
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb update [--check] [--version <ver>] [--dry-run] [--json]\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks for and installs a newer SecretHarbor CLI and runtime version. Does not alter project security policy. Features cryptographic checksum and signature verification, atomic replacement with automatic rollback, and agent lockout protection.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB-c\fR, \fB--check\fR
Check for newer versions without installing
.TP
\fB-v\fR, \fB--version\fR
Target a specific release version
.TP
\fB-n\fR, \fB--dry-run\fR
Simulate download and signature verification without replacing binary
.TP
\fB-j\fR, \fB--json\fR
Output update check results in JSON format
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb update\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb update --check\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb update --version 0.1.0\fR
.TP
$ \fBshb update --dry-run\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://github.com/logn10/SecretHarbor
